&mdash; PassionUA.gg (@PassionuaGG) <a href="https://twitter.com/PassionuaGG/status/2049504328084283825?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">April 29, 2026</a></blockquote>
<script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
<h3 class="news-block">A Passion UA&nbsp;legval&oacute;sz&iacute;nűbb&nbsp;fel&aacute;ll&aacute;sa az IEM Atlantan</h3>
